OL,3,GNEWSAMurder victim tried to shield
OL,4,Ahimself, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was found dead after being
OL,7,Fpushed into a marina tried to shield
OL,8,Fhimself from the punches delivered by
OL,9,Fthe man accused of murdering him, a
OL,10,Fcourt heard.
OL,12,FLayton Randle, 19, of Oakfield Terrace
OL,13,FRoad, Plymouth, denies murdering Drew
OL,14,FPerham at King Point Marina in the city
OL,15,Fin the early hours of 24 January.
OL,17,FIn a police video interview played to
OL,18,Fthe court, witness Charlie Morgan said
OL,19,Fthere had been a sudden switch in
OL,20,FRandle's behaviour and he began
OL,21,F"bouncing on his toes" as if he was
OL,22,Fbeginning to fight.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
